WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,310
Which set should I buy if I am pressed for time?

2
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:05,860
Of course, the model villa I just saw cost 45 million.

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:09,340
You know that the full amount plus tax is not a decimal, right? I know it very well.

4
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,380
To get a loan, you need to go through an extremely tedious self-examination process at the bank.

5
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,180
Are you sure your turnover can be brought to the payment?

6
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,500
Still talking about face

7
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:18,260
It is impossible to pass the loan review of 45 million yuan

8
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:22,300
Why does it have to humiliate itself? No need to go to the bank for the full payment

9
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:28,530
The full amount of 45 million is subject to a commission of 2.5% stipulated by the company.

10
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:32,590
Advocacy organizations have 1,125,000 God wait a minute

11
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:37,790
I still don’t believe what I said just now in the lobby of the villa.

12
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:41,310
Do you want me to pull out the bank card balance on the spot and show it to you? No, no, no.

13
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:42,990
Senior, I'm sorry. I really didn't mean it.

14
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:44,150
You are so kind

15
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:45,630
I'll call the finance department here.

16
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:47,780
The transaction was successfully deducted in RMB

17
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,260
Forty-five million yuan

18
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,290
This is really a full deduction
